libunibreak
------------------------------------------
Library to implement Unicode algorithms for line and word breaking

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libunibreak-devel-8.0-1bl1
  libunibreak8-8.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/adah1972/libunibreak

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/adah1972/libunibreak/archive/refs/tags/libunibreak_8_0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libunibreak-8.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libunibreak-8.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libunibreak-8.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libunibreak-8.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libunibreak8-8.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libunibreak-devel-8.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libunibreak)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libunibreak.README
  /usr/share/doc/libunibreak/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libunibreak/LICENCE
  /usr/share/doc/libunibreak/NEWS
  /usr/share/doc/libunibreak/README.md

(libunibreak8)
  /usr/bin/cygunibreak-8.dll

(libunibreak-devel)
  /usr/include/libunibreak/graphemebreak.h
  /usr/include/libunibreak/linebreak.h
  /usr/include/libunibreak/unibreakbase.h
  /usr/include/libunibreak/unibreakdef.h
  /usr/include/libunibreak/wordbreak.h
  /usr/lib/libunibreak.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libunibreak.pc

